## 4. Componentes-base (atoms)

### 4.1 `<Icon name size color stroke>`
SVG inline 24×24 viewBox, paths-only, stroke `currentColor`, linecap/linejoin `round`.
**Lista de ícones usada (33 total):** `back, mic, mic2, shield, lock, eye, eyeOff, check, x, chevron, chevronDown, plus, heart, user, target, activity, home, calendar, brain, accessibility, sparkles, voice, pill, ruler, zap, shieldCheck, trendUp, trendDown, trendFlat, bars, trophy, flame, warning, body, layers, filter, download, refresh, arrowRight`.

### 4.2 `<ScreenWrap>`
Container das telas. `padding: 14px 18px 100px`, `display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px`.

### 4.3 `<ScreenTitle kicker title sub>`
Header de tela:
- Kicker: mono 10px, cyan, .18em, UPPERCASE, margin-bottom 4px
- Title: H1 (display 22, weight 700, -0.01em, line 1.15)
- Sub: 12px, textSec, line 1.45, margin-top 4px

### 4.4 `<Section title right children pad=true>`
Card-seção:
- `background: surfRaised`, `borderRadius: 16`, `border: 1px solid border`
- Header: padding `11px 14px 9px`, `borderBottom: 1px dashed border`, com title em mono uppercase + slot `right` (geralmente badge/delta)
- Body: padding 14px (ou 0 se `pad=false`)

### 4.5 `<StatCard kicker value sub color big deltaTone>`
Card de métrica:
- Padding 12px, radius 12px, `background: navy`, `border: 1px solid border`
- Kicker: mono 9.5px, textMute, .08em, UPPERCASE
- Value: display 22px (ou 26 se `big`), weight 800, color customizado, -0.02em, line 1.05
- Sub: 10.5px, mono, cor conforme `deltaTone` (`good`=green, `bad`=coral, `neutral`=textSec)

### 4.6 `<AIMessage icon title body tone action>`
Card de mensagem da IA — **assinatura visual do módulo**:
```jsx
{
  padding: 14,
  borderRadius: 14,
  background: `linear-gradient(135deg, ${c}18 0%, ${c}06 100%)`,
  border: `1px solid ${c}55`,
  display: 'flex', gap: 12,
}
```
- **Ícone 30×30** (radius 9, fundo `${c}22`, color `c`) à esquerda
- **Kicker:** "IA · {title}" (mono 10px, cor `c`, .12em, UPPERCASE)
- **Body:** 13px, line 1.5
- **Action box** (opcional): margin-top 8, padding `8px 10px`, radius 8, `background: navy`, `border: 1px dashed ${c}55`, com ícone `arrowRight` + texto "**Ação:** ..."

Tonalidades disponíveis: `cyan` (default), `coral` (crítico), `amber` (atenção), `green` (positivo), `lavender` (prova de valor).

### 4.7 `<ScoreRing score size color label sub thin=8>`
Anel circular com score central:
- SVG rotacionado -90deg
- Track: stroke border, thickness `thin`
- Progress: stroke `color`, `stroke-dasharray = 2πr`, `stroke-dashoffset` proporcional
- Centro: número grande (display 22, weight 800) + label mono 8.5px UPPERCASE + sub opcional 9px
- Transição: `stroke-dashoffset .6s ease`

### 4.8 `<Sparkline data color height=48 fill showDots>`
Linha + área:
- viewBox `240 × height`, `preserveAspectRatio: none`
- Path linear unindo pontos (sem suavização)
- Área: linear-gradient vertical de `${color}` (35% opacity topo → 0% bottom)
- Stroke 2px, linecap round
- Dots opcionais: r=2.2 (último: r=3.5), fill navy, stroke color

### 4.9 `<BarChart data labels color height=100 suffix>`
Barras verticais:
- Container `display: flex; align-items: flex-end`, gap 6px
- Cada barra: max-width 24px, altura proporcional a `max * 1.1`
- Cor: última barra `linear-gradient(180deg, color, color88)` + `box-shadow 0 0 16px ${color}66`; demais `${color}55`
- `borderRadius: 6px 6px 2px 2px`
- Animação: `grow-bar .6s ease-out` com delay `${i * 0.05}s`, origem bottom
- Valor acima da barra (mono 9.5, weight 600); label abaixo (mono 9, textMute)

### 4.10 `<DualLine series height=120>`
Multi-linha com eixo:
- viewBox `260 × height`, padding interno 16px
- Grid: 3 linhas dashed (25%, 50%, 75%) em border
- Cada serie: `{ data, color, dashed? }`
- Path stroke 2.2px, linecap round
- Pontos: r=1.8 (último: r=3), fill navy

### 4.11 `<BodyDiagram highlights={[{region, intensity}]}>`
Silhueta humana estilizada (80×160 SVG):
- Cabeça: círculo r=10 cx=40 cy=14, stroke borderSoft 1.5
- Pescoço: linha (40,24)→(40,30), stroke borderSoft 2
- Torso: path `M 26 30 L 54 30 L 56 68 L 50 96 L 30 96 L 24 68 Z`, fill surfRaised, stroke borderSoft
- **Zona lombar (highlight):** ellipse cx=40 cy=72 rx=12 ry=7 fill `coral55` stroke coral + círculo dashed externo r=14
- Braços: linhas (26,34)→(14,64) e (54,34)→(66,64), stroke borderSoft 3, linecap round
- Mãos: círculos r=3 nos endpoints, fill borderSoft
- Pernas: linhas (34,96)→(30,140) e (46,96)→(50,140), stroke 4
- Pés: ellipses rx=6 ry=3
- Label "LOMBAR" em mono 7px, coral, .06em, abaixo (y=158)

